detaileddescription.para:
Three additional conditional constants support the composition of other conditions: 


NotCondition - evaluates to true iff the specified condition evaluates to false, i.e. a "not" condition; 



AllCondition - evaluates to true iff each of the specified conditions evaluate to true, i.e. an "and" condition; 



AnyCondition - evaluates to false iff each of the specified conditions evaluate to false, i.e. an "or" condition;
